{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>וישתחו</b> in gematria: giving thanks for the good tidings." "<b>על המטה</b> — two times in the Masorah: וישב על המטה · והמן נופל על המטה. The righteous even when weak grow strong, as stated: ויתחזק ישראל וישב על המטה — and the wicked even in their strength fall, as stated: והמן נופל על המטה."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:31.500278712Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}